 "remarks": "Welcome to The Maritime, South Norwalk's premier waterfront condo complex offering modern luxury in the heart of historic SoNo. The unit features a light-filled open floor plan with a spacious living room and a gourmet dine-in kitchen equipped with granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and ample cabinet and pantry storage. The sun-drenched primary suite boasts floor-to-ceiling windows showcasing picturesque downtown views, complete with a generous walk-in closet and an in-unit washer and dryer. Complex residents enjoy upscale amenities including a fully equipped fitness center, a community recreation room with a fireplace and kitchenette, a professional conference room, and secure underground parking. Situated within walking distance to some of Fairfield County's best restaurants, coastal parks, beaches, local galleries, boutique shops, the Maritime Aquarium, the SoNo Collection mall, and the Metro-North train station, this light-filled home delivers vibrant coastal city living without the hustle and bustle.",
